ard  fighting to survive and fighting for a  chance  and eventually those fights and those  chances that everyone around you is also  competing for  start to wear you down and you start to  look for easier ways to get the things  you need  even if it's against the law so as a  consequence  when she was 16 years old she was  arrested on burglary charges  when presented to the judge for a  sentencing he was impressed by her calm  and collected manner  and gave her the option of either  juvenile reformatory or working with the  boppay as an informant  she believed by joining bopay that they  would support and encourage her to  continue in cultivating her devious  tendencies  which would serve them and also herself  while undercover  this proved to be a good choice for her  as years of undercover operations within  brazil's notorious gangs  made her a master of surveillance and  interrogation techniques  eventually the judge's mandatory time  she had to serve came to an end  but she could no longer see herself  doing anything else she had finally  found her place in the world  and so she quickly re-enlisted with  bopay  recognized as an expert in the field she  often found herself called upon when  conducting training exercises within the  force  rainbow formally invited cavita to join  them in 2016  as a result of a key role as an  interrogator during the 2010 rio de  janeiro security crisis  although she had undermined bopay  protocol they were not deterred  in 2019 caveira went awol and killed  several santa blanca gang members  this was in response to them kidnapping  her brother after his cover was blown  and it was discovered that he was  working for the federal police of brazil  valkyrie and twitch collaborated with  ghost recon to recover her  in an enterprise by the name of  operation archangel  although it's fair to say that while the  mission was a success they caused  tension between kevira and valkyrie  not one to think before she acts  especially when a fa